<h3>Medical opportunity cost</h3>
<p>Spending time on an intervention that may not fit the structural problem, while delaying a more appropriate evaluation or treatment pathway.</p>
</article>
<article class="sc-risk-card">
<span class="sc-risk-card__icon">
