<section data-screen-label="Proposal checklist" style="background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(56px,7vw,104px) 0">
<div style="width:min(100% - clamp(64px,14vw,128px),1200px);margin-inline:auto">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,4vw,64px);align-items:start;margin-bottom:clamp(36px,4vw,56px)">
<div>
<span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:2px solid var(--sand-500);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:var(--ls-eyebrow);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand-700)">Before comparing prices</span>
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(31px,3.9vw,52px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink-950)">What Should a Credible Knee Treatment Proposal Tell You?</h2>
</div>
<div>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:64ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">A serious proposal should become more specific the closer you get to treatment. If a clinic cannot explain the product, rationale and expected outcome clearly, the problem is bigger than price.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(max(230px,25% - 1px),1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--line-on-light);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">01</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">What exactly will be administered?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">A specific biological product, not a vague category label.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">02</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">Where does it come from?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Autologous, donor, bone marrow, adipose or perinatal source.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">03</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">How is it processed?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Collection, preparation, culture expansion and manufacturing matter.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">04</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">How is dose verified?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Marketing cell counts are not enough without meaningful characterization.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">05</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">What evidence supports it?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">For this exact product and diagnosis, not regenerative medicine in general.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">06</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">Who reviewed your imaging?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Treatment should follow diagnosis, not precede it.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">07</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">What outcome is realistic?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Pain, function, structural change and disease modification are different claims.</span></div>
<div style="background:var(--white);padding:24px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 16px"><span style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--radius-circle);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sand-700)">08</span><strong style="font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">What happens after treatment?</strong><span style="grid-column:2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Follow-up, rehabilitation and complication planning should be clear.</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
