<blockquote style="margin:18px 0 0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,25px);line-height:1.35;color:var(--text-on-dark-secondary)">“Our proprietary stem cells regenerate cartilage with a 95% success rate and will keep you from needing knee replacement.”</blockquote>
